    "body": "The Army is moving to reshape its future, with modernization priorities, acquisition strategies and emerging technologies driving change across the force.\nAt the 2026 Association of the United States Army (AUSA) Annual Meeting and Exposition, Army leaders and industry representatives discussed the challenges and opportunities shaping that effort, from autonomous systems and drone warfare to industrial capacity and acquisition reform.\nBreaking Defense brings together its coverage in AUSA 2026: The Ground Truth — After-Action Report , examining the decisions, programs and technologies shaping the Army’s next chapter.\nNo registration required.",
